{"logId": "f4bf6e5f-6640-424e-a3fb-8a91110da9c3", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [839, 135, 1083, 253], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [839.0, 253.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "用心才会快乐", "block_bbox": [281, 229, 600, 285], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[281.0, 229.0], [600.0, 229.0], [600.0, 285.0], [281.0, 285.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：新乡百货/常亚利", "block_bbox": [424, 293, 599, 315], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[424.0, 293.0], [598.0, 293.0], [598.0, 314.0], [424.0, 314.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "清楚地记得那是我刚到超市不久发生的一件事。有一天上午，一位阿姨来到了我们厅选锅，最后选中了一款45元的炒锅。当我带她到收银台交款时，看到45元的价位，她非常生气，说：“昨天还卖29.9元，今天就涨到了45元，这不明摆着玩人吗？”无论我怎么解释她都不听，我也很生气，就不理她了。最后阿姨非常生气地走了，我也没再多做解释，当从同事口中得知，这位阿姨经常来这里，昨天已经看好这锅，只因钱不够，所以今天就过来了，谁知又恢复了原价。我听后赶紧出门把阿姨追回来，让她留下了电话和住址。我说：“阿姨，这事我会帮你解决的，请放心。”阿姨没理我，转身走了。可能是因为我之前的态度让她不能相信我吧！回到厅里，同事过来，说我刚才确实不应该和顾客急，应该耐心地向她解释清楚。认识到自己的错误，我也很后悔。中午下了班，我买了点水果，带上锅让那位同事陪我一起去了阿姨家。当我们说明了来意之后，阿姨又感动又惊喜，说光听说胖东来的服务好，还以为就那样，谁知你们竟然为了这一点小事而登门拜访，实在难得呀！阿姨忙招呼我们坐下，和阿姨的闲聊中得知阿姨和她的老伴都常年受病痛的折磨，靠药物来支撑着身体，儿女在外地也帮不上忙。看到朴实的阿姨和她老伴热情好客的态度，我自愧不如。", "block_bbox": [197, 372, 977, 852], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 372.0], [977.0, 372.0], [977.0, 852.0], [197.0, 852.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们要走了，阿姨看到我们也没收钱的意思，非硬塞给我们50元钱，说是锅钱和水果钱，没办法我们只好收了30元。这时阿姨拉着我的手说：", "block_bbox": [323, 860, 968, 921], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[323.0, 860.0], [968.0, 860.0], [968.0, 921.0], [323.0, 921.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [212, 912, 566, 1240], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[212.0, 912.0], [566.0, 912.0], [566.0, 1240.0], [212.0, 1240.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "“闺女，你的态度不错，阿姨谢谢你，就是脾气有点躁，以后改改。”听着阿姨朴实的话语，我心里很不是滋味。阿姨她有一颗宽宏大量的心，也更善解人意，是阿姨的行动感动了我。\n回去的路上，我和那位同事谈了很多，谈到了我们的服务，就像东来哥说的只有用心才能做好，只有用心才会感恩，服务不是纸上谈兵的事，它是用实际行动做出来的，只有用心给别人带来快乐的时候，自己才是最快乐的。", "block_bbox": [541, 930, 976, 1061], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[541.0, 930.0], [976.0, 930.0], [976.0, 1061.0], [541.0, 1061.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [577, 1070, 977, 1236], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[577.0, 1070.0], [977.0, 1070.0], [977.0, 1236.0], [577.0, 1236.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "坎坷经历成就财富", "block_bbox": [111, 1407, 400, 1448], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [400.0, 1407.0], [400.0, 1448.0], [111.0, 1448.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1002, 611, 1138, 725], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[1002.0, 611.0], [1138.0, 611.0], [1138.0, 725.0], [1002.0, 725.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7055630683898926, "coordinate": [839, 135, 1083, 253], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [839.0, 253.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.8989503383636475, "coordinate": [281, 229, 600, 285], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[281.0, 229.0], [600.0, 229.0], [600.0, 285.0], [281.0, 285.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7810541391372681, "coordinate": [424, 293, 599, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[424.0, 293.0], [598.0, 293.0], [598.0, 314.0], [424.0, 314.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9632877111434937, "coordinate": [197, 372, 977, 852], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 372.0], [977.0, 372.0], [977.0, 852.0], [197.0, 852.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7091240882873535, "coordinate": [323, 860, 968, 921], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[323.0, 860.0], [968.0, 860.0], [968.0, 921.0], [323.0, 921.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9245650172233582, "coordinate": [212, 912, 566, 1240], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[212.0, 912.0], [566.0, 912.0], [566.0, 1240.0], [212.0, 1240.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8919456601142883, "coordinate": [541, 930, 976, 1061], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[541.0, 930.0], [976.0, 930.0], [976.0, 1061.0], [541.0, 1061.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9438570737838745, "coordinate": [577, 1070, 977, 1236], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[577.0, 1070.0], [977.0, 1070.0], [977.0, 1236.0], [577.0, 1236.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5167152881622314, "coordinate": [111, 1407, 400, 1448], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [400.0, 1407.0], [400.0, 1448.0], [111.0, 1448.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5558938980102539, "coordinate": [1002, 611, 1138, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1002.0, 611.0], [1138.0, 611.0], [1138.0, 725.0], [1002.0, 725.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 用心才会快乐\n\n作者：新乡百货/常亚利\n\n清楚地记得那是我刚到超市不久发生的一件事。有一天上午，一位阿姨来到了我们厅选锅，最后选中了一款45元的炒锅。当我带她到收银台交款时，看到45元的价位，她非常生气，说：“昨天还卖29.9元，今天就涨到了45元，这不明摆着玩人吗？”无论我怎么解释她都不听，我也很生气，就不理她了。最后阿姨非常生气地走了，我也没再多做解释，当从同事口中得知，这位阿姨经常来这里，昨天已经看好这锅，只因钱不够，所以今天就过来了，谁知又恢复了原价。我听后赶紧出门把阿姨追回来，让她留下了电话和住址。我说：“阿姨，这事我会帮你解决的，请放心。”阿姨没理我，转身走了。可能是因为我之前的态度让她不能相信我吧！回到厅里，同事过来，说我刚才确实不应该和顾客急，应该耐心地向她解释清楚。认识到自己的错误，我也很后悔。中午下了班，我买了点水果，带上锅让那位同事陪我一起去了阿姨家。当我们说明了来意之后，阿姨又感动又惊喜，说光听说胖东来的服务好，还以为就那样，谁知你们竟然为了这一点小事而登门拜访，实在难得呀！阿姨忙招呼我们坐下，和阿姨的闲聊中得知阿姨和她的老伴都常年受病痛的折磨，靠药物来支撑着身体，儿女在外地也帮不上忙。看到朴实的阿姨和她老伴热情好客的态度，我自愧不如。\n\n我们要走了，阿姨看到我们也没收钱的意思，非硬塞给我们50元钱，说是锅钱和水果钱，没办法我们只好收了30元。这时阿姨拉着我的手说：\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_212_912_566_1240.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"29%\" /></div>\n\n\n“闺女，你的态度不错，阿姨谢谢你，就是脾气有点躁，以后改改。”听着阿姨朴实的话语，我心里很不是滋味。阿姨她有一颗宽宏大量的心，也更善解人意，是阿姨的行动感动了我。\n\n回去的路上，我和那位同事谈了很多，谈到了我们的服务，就像东来哥说的只有用心才能做好，只有用心才会感恩，服务不是纸上谈兵的事，它是用实际行动做出来的，只有用心给别人带来快乐的时候，自己才是最快乐的。\n\n\n\n## 坎坷经历成就财富\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_611_1138_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1083_253.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f4bf6e5f-6640-424e-a3fb-8a91110da9c3/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1083_253.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A18%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Ffd7ec1af3a3ae92bb1b34ef83d92326a88bd0f6141f9f3a2d1e47bfda6301f40", "imgs/img_in_image_box_212_912_566_1240.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f4bf6e5f-6640-424e-a3fb-8a91110da9c3/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_212_912_566_1240.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A18%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Fea29a1bb4a98c8043648ed8ecddc41e85a2b952a7c84bb06a49113593d8075ed", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_611_1138_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f4bf6e5f-6640-424e-a3fb-8a91110da9c3/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_611_1138_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A18%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc4017cb1b7c2a071174b556f976d6c09907358f1cf58c4970fff4cff85d249a7"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f4bf6e5f-6640-424e-a3fb-8a91110da9c3/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A18%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2F42359376a4faad68c463e770927bb5f73b494bdcebff3a1d9b192480017e5500"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f4bf6e5f-6640-424e-a3fb-8a91110da9c3/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A18%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2Fd000dbd9cee91c4b3d9eb572ed614ad9b83016414bb7ccb45276f9727b27b2ab"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f4bf6e5f-6640-424e-a3fb-8a91110da9c3/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A18%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2Faede4990dc627c1dec49457dad6e64eef3eb4f387abad8a7ba1d8dc328445044"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
